  "bio": "Dan Barker, renowned for his expertise in illustrative and realism styles, is a highly skilled tattoo artist operating out of True Blue Tattoo in Lakewood, Colorado. Clients have consistently praised Dan for his professionalism, ensuring not only stunning artistic results but also a respectful and dedicated approach throughout the entire tattooing process. With a reputation for excellence in such intricate genres, he remains a sought-after tattoo artist in the Lakewood area.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lakewood, Colorado, United States\n\nAt True Blue Tattoo, Lakewood Colorado 303-989-OUCH",
